Piko
====

The runtime resource-overlay theming technique used by the "Mod settings" /
"Appearance" patches (`ModThemeApi31.java`, `OverlayTable.kt` — compiling a
standalone `.arsc` overlay and applying it via `android.content.res.loader.
ResourcesLoader`) is adapted from Piko, a Morphe patches collection for
Twitter/X and Instagram:

https://github.com/crimera/piko

Piko is licensed under GPLv3 with its own additional terms under Section 7;
see Piko's repository for the authoritative text of those terms. This
project's use of that technique is credited here, and in source comments on
the files above, in compliance with those terms.
